###
### BigCommerce Migration API Test Suite
### Local Development Testing - http://localhost:7071
### NOTE: API key authentication is temporarily disabled for local testing
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@contentType = application/json

### Variables for test data
@testSourceStoreId = "tmdsef6c6o"
@testSourceAccessToken = "ar247sdrwg6b5oo4c8h2n2nu2yat0w7"
@testDestStoreId = "in2msaitrc"  
@testDestAccessToken = "bntqbbjvnnap8agkdbo5bekqehb473z"
@testChannelId = 1

###
### 1. Health Check / List All Migrations (Empty Response Expected Initially)
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### 2. Create New Migration - Categories Only
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "entities": ["categories"],
  "sourceStore": {
    "storeId": "{{testSourceStoreId}}",
    "accessToken": "{{testSourceAccessToken}}",
    "channelId": "{{testChannelId}}"
  },
  "destinationStore": {
    "storeId": "{{testDestStoreId}}",
    "accessToken": "{{testDestAccessToken}}",
    "channelId": "{{testChannelId}}"
  }
}

###
### 3. Create New Migration - Multiple Entities
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "entities": ["categories", "brands", "products"],
  "sourceStore": {
    "storeId": "{{testSourceStoreId}}",
    "accessToken": "{{testSourceAccessToken}}",
    "channelId": "{{testChannelId}}"
  },
  "destinationStore": {
    "storeId": "{{testDestStoreId}}",
    "accessToken": "{{testDestAccessToken}}",
    "channelId": "{{testChannelId}}"
  }
}

###
### 4. Get Migration Status (Replace {migrationId} with actual ID from previous response)
###
@migrationId = replace-with-actual-migration-id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations/{{migrationId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### 5. Cancel Migration (Replace {migrationId} with actual ID)
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations/{{migrationId}}/cancel
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### 6. List Migrations with Status Filter
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations?status=queued&pageSize=10&page=1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### 7. List Migrations with Different Status
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations?status=inprogress
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
